[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0822","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0822.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21360","title":"Microsoft AutoUpdate (MAU) 特权提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft AutoUpdate (MAU) 存在权限管理不当漏洞，该工具作为 macOS 平台上 Microsoft 系列应用（如 Office）的自动更新组件，以高权限运行。本地低权限攻击者可利用 MAU 对更新文件或进程间通信的权限校验缺陷，通过构造恶意更新包或劫持 MAU 的更新流程，将自身权限提升至 root 级别，从而完全控制系统。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，影响所有使用 MAU 的 macOS 系统。Microsoft 已在相关安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21360"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:11Z","remediation":"将 Microsoft AutoUpdate for Mac 升级到 4.76 或更高版本。macOS 用户可通过 Microsoft AutoUpdate 内置更新功能（菜单栏 → 帮助 → 检查更新）自动获取修复版本，也可从 https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=830196 手动下载最新安装包。如无法立即更新，建议限制受影响 Mac 系统的本地登录用户权限，仅允许受信任的管理员账户操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21360","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21360.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/be53b1e1fe165098245bfbe673cd589934da7e3a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21360.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21360.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21360.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21360.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21360.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21360.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21360/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2025/CVE-2025-21360.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21360/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0822.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0818","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0818.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21357","title":"Microsoft Outlook 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook 存在远程代码执行漏洞，源于对特制文件对象的不当处理（CWE-908：使用未初始化资源）。本地攻击者需获取低权限账户并诱导目标用户打开恶意构造的 Outlook 文件，利用高复杂度攻击步骤触发未初始化内存访问，从而在目标系统上以当前用户上下文执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Outlook 多个受支持版本，CVSS 评分 6.7，危害等级中危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.7,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21357"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:11Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新。Outlook 2016 用户应升级至 16.0.5483.1000 及以上版本；Microsoft 365 企业版、Office 2019、Office LTSC 2021/2024 用户请通过 https://aka.ms/OfficeSecurityReleases 获取并安装最新安全更新，或通过 Microsoft Update 自动更新。由于该漏洞需本地访问且利用条件复杂（CWE-908 未初始化资源使用），无法立即打补丁时可限制受影响用户登录权限、启用 Windows Defender 攻击面减少规则（ASR）阻止 Office 创建子进程作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21357","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2025/CVE-2025-21357.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2025/CVE-2025-21357.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21357.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21357.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21357.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21357.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21357.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21357.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21357.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21357.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0818.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0817","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0817.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21356","title":"Microsoft Office Visio 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office Visio 存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制的 Visio 文件触发该漏洞。成功利用此漏洞的攻击者可在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码，实现完全控制目标系统。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需特殊权限，但需要用户交互。影响范围涵盖受支持的 Microsoft Office Visio 版本。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21356"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:10Z","remediation":"建议立即通过 Microsoft Update 或访问 https://aka.ms/OfficeSecurityReleases 安装 2025 年 1 月 Visio 安全更新。对于 Microsoft 365 订阅用户，确保已启用自动更新并重启 Office 应用。对于 Office LTSC 2019/2021/2024 用户，请运行 Windows Update 或手动下载对应版本的安全更新包进行安装。临时缓解措施：不要打开来自不可信来源的 Visio 文件（.vsd/.vsdx），并在组策略中禁用 Visio 中的 ActiveX 和宏执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21356","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21356.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21356.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21356.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21356.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21356.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21356.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21356.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21356/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08861b52e373e5d8411b1b6670fe650ef2757f4b/2025/CVE-2025-21356.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21356/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0817.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0815","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0815.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21354","title":"Microsoft Excel 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Excel 存在远程代码执行漏洞，由于程序在处理特制 Office 文件时未能正确验证指针引用（CWE-822），攻击者可通过诱导用户打开恶意构造的 Excel 文档触发该漏洞，导致在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多个 Microsoft Excel 版本，CVSS 评分 8.4，危害等级高危，可导致敏感数据泄露、数据篡改或系统完全受控。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21354"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:10Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新。各通道最低修复版本：Current Channel 2501 Build 18429.20158、Monthly Enterprise Channel 2412 Build 18324.20240、Semi-Annual Enterprise Channel 2408 Build 17928.20440、Office LTSC 2024 2408 Build 17932.20252、Office LTSC 2021 2108 Build 14332.20857、Office 2019 1808 Build 10416.20058。可通过 Windows Update 或访问 https://aka.ms/OfficeSecurityReleases 获取更新。Office Online Server 需升级至 16.0.10416.20047 及以上版本。如无法立即更新，建议禁用从不受信任来源打开 Excel 文件的功能，并在组织中启用受保护视图和文件阻止策略作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21354","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21354.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21354.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21354.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21354.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21354.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21354.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21354/README.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21354.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08861b52e373e5d8411b1b6670fe650ef2757f4b/2025/CVE-2025-21354.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21354/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0815.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0808","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0808.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21348","title":"Microsoft SharePoint Server 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft SharePoint Server 存在远程代码执行漏洞，该漏洞源于权限验证（CWE-285）不足，具有高权限的认证攻击者可通过网络向受影响 SharePoint 服务器发送特制请求触发漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上以 SharePoint 服务账户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft SharePoint Server 多个受支持版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21348"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:09Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新，具体版本：SharePoint Enterprise Server 2016 升级至 16.0.5483.1001，SharePoint Server 2019 升级至 16.0.10416.20041，SharePoint Server Subscription Edition 升级至 16.0.17928.20356。可通过 Microsoft Update 自动更新或从 MSRC 下载补丁手动安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制对 SharePoint 服务器的网络访问，仅允许受信任管理员 IP 连接，并审查高权限用户账户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21348","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21348.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21348.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21348.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21348.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21348.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21348.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21348.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21348/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8eb5179bc94e368fed99f8f208b080aa4b8a56b8/2025/CVE-2025-21348.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21348/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0808.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0805","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0805.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21346","title":"Microsoft Office 安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 存在安全功能绕过漏洞，该漏洞源于 Office 安全机制（CWE-693）的防护不足。攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制的 Office 文件，利用该漏洞绕过 Office 的安全防护功能（如受保护的视图、宏安全策略等），从而在用户系统上执行未经授权的操作，导致系统完整性及可用性受到高影响。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需特权，但需要用户交互。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21346"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:09Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新，通过 Microsoft Update 或访问 https://aka.ms/OfficeSecurityReleases 获取最新补丁。Office 2016 用户需升级至 16.0.5483.1001 及以上版本；Office 2019/LTSC 2021/LTSC 2024 及 Microsoft 365 Apps 用户请安装对应渠道的最新安全更新。临时缓解措施：在组策略中启用\"受保护视图\"并禁用来自不受信任来源的宏执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21346","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ca27d016571e65b8b794044c0722f4842d8c02cb/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21346.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/23f497cfa900b1c0908e9aaab11ef4e5e9bc8af3/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21346.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be58e0e3c542843372e0883fccedcf7e869f2994/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21346.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be58e0e3c542843372e0883fccedcf7e869f2994/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21346.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21346.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21346.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21346.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/20685f8e9cef6fd20273361a30b970dad9a34268/2025/CVE-2025-21346/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bdca00fd5e56fb1f56cf43ba50e05560bd4f2fcd/2025/CVE-2025-21346.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/20685f8e9cef6fd20273361a30b970dad9a34268/2025/CVE-2025-21346/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0805.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0804","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0804.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21345","title":"Microsoft Office Visio 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"这是一个利用使用后释放漏洞攻击 Microsoft Office Visio 的远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者通过向目标系统发送精心 crafted 的 Visio 文件，利用程序在处理特定文件时出现的内存使用后释放漏洞，触发缓冲区溢出或代码执行。攻击无需身份验证，只需诱骗受害者打开恶意文件即可，而攻击复杂度较低。当漏洞被利用时，攻击者可以完全控制受影响系统，执行任意代码，窃取敏感数据，甚至破坏系统完整性。该漏洞影响各种 Windows 版本上的 Microsoft Office Visio 产品，CVSS 评分高达 7.8（高级别），危害极其严重。微软已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，用户应及时安装补丁以确保系统安全。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21345"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:09Z","remediation":"建议立即通过 Microsoft 官方安全更新渠道（https://aka.ms/OfficeSecurityReleases）安装 2025 年 1 月发布的 Visio 安全更新。Microsoft 365 Apps for Enterprise 用户应确保通过 Microsoft 365 更新通道获取最新版本；Office 2019/LTSC 2021/LTSC 2024 用户需安装对应版本的安全更新补丁。如无法立即打补丁，可配置组策略禁止从网络位置打开 Visio 文件，并提醒用户不要打开来源不明的 Visio 文档作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21345","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ca27d016571e65b8b794044c0722f4842d8c02cb/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21345.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66c0b846661d24b6c0080f2afee2bfee1abc93b1/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21345.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21345.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21345.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21345.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21345.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21345.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/b2e322807736508fdac4568eba00e998f4358b30/2025/CVE-2025-21345/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f050e8fca5626f412366605b1f58958789b2919/2025/CVE-2025-21345.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/b2e322807736508fdac4568eba00e998f4358b30/2025/CVE-2025-21345/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0804.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0803","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0803.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21344","title":"Microsoft SharePoint Server 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft SharePoint Server 存在远程代码执行漏洞，源于对用户输入验证不当（CWE-20），攻击者可构造恶意文件诱导用户打开，触发代码执行。该漏洞影响 SharePoint Server 多个版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8（HIGH），攻击向量为本地（AV:L），需用户交互（UI:R）但无需权限（PR:N），成功利用可完全控制服务器的机密性、完整性和可用性。Microsoft 已于 2025 年 1 月发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21344"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:09Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新：SharePoint Enterprise Server 2016 升级至 16.0.5483.1001，SharePoint Server 2019 升级至 16.0.10416.20041，SharePoint Server Subscription Edition 升级至 16.0.17928.20356。可通过 Microsoft Update 或 Windows Server Update Services (WSUS) 自动部署。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制对 SharePoint 服务器的本地访问权限，并禁用不必要的用户交互功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21344","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21344.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66c0b846661d24b6c0080f2afee2bfee1abc93b1/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21344.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21344.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21344.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21344.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21344.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21344.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/bf5dea028c86f55a03785d02865b31b708a44bbb/2025/CVE-2025-21344/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f050e8fca5626f412366605b1f58958789b2919/2025/CVE-2025-21344.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/bf5dea028c86f55a03785d02865b31b708a44bbb/2025/CVE-2025-21344/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0803.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0803.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0802","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0802.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21343","title":"Microsoft Windows Web 威胁防御用户服务信息泄露漏洞","description":"Windows Web 威胁防御用户服务存在权限管理不当漏洞，导致未授权信息泄露。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用该服务对 Web 威胁的检测处理机制，在无需用户交互的情况下获取目标系统的敏感信息，造成机密性影响。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21343"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:16:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:09Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050021)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。安装后重启系统使修复生效。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制 Web Threat Defense 服务的网络访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21343","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21343.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66c0b846661d24b6c0080f2afee2bfee1abc93b1/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21343.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21343.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21343.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21343.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21343.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21343.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/57399edd0cb922ca63d77ada5c7a83d5fa95eb6e/2025/CVE-2025-21343/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f050e8fca5626f412366605b1f58958789b2919/2025/CVE-2025-21343.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/57399edd0cb922ca63d77ada5c7a83d5fa95eb6e/2025/CVE-2025-21343/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0802.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0799","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0799.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21341","title":"Microsoft Windows 数字媒体特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 数字媒体组件存在越界读取漏洞（CWE-125）。需要物理接触目标设备的低权限本地攻击者可利用该漏洞实现特权提升。该漏洞影响 Windows 10、Windows 11 及 Windows Server 等多个版本的系统，CVSS 评分 6.6（中危）。攻击无需用户交互且攻击复杂度低，成功利用后攻击者可完全访问系统敏感数据、篡改系统文件并导致系统拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21341"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:59Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:08Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050061)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。受影响版本包括 Windows 10/11 全系列及 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016/2019/2022/2025，各版本对应修复版本号见 MSRC 公告。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制本地物理访问权限，因为该漏洞需要物理访问 (AV:P) 且攻击者需具备低权限账户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21341","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21341.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66c0b846661d24b6c0080f2afee2bfee1abc93b1/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21341.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21341.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21341.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/57399edd0cb922ca63d77ada5c7a83d5fa95eb6e/2025/CVE-2025-21341/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21341.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/57399edd0cb922ca63d77ada5c7a83d5fa95eb6e/2025/CVE-2025-21341/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21341.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5606c11566e9461a0d44f0944086969cb6810ef1/2025/CVE-2025-21341.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21341"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0799.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0798","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0798.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21340","title":"Microsoft Windows 基于虚拟化的安全性 (VBS) 安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"Windows 基于虚拟化的安全性 (VBS) 存在安全功能绕过漏洞。由于 VBS 在实现安全隔离机制时存在逻辑缺陷，具有低权限本地账户的攻击者可以通过运行特制的应用程序，在无需用户交互的情况下绕过 VBS 的保护措施。此漏洞影响多种 Windows 操作系统版本，成功利用后可破坏系统内核隔离，导致机密数据泄露或为更高权限的攻击提供跳板。CVSS 评分为 5.5，危害等级为中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21340"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:59Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:08Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5050021（OS Builds 22621.4751 和 22631.4751），可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。该更新修复了 VBS 安全功能绕过漏洞，防止低权限攻击者绕过 VBS 隔离机制读取敏感信息。如无法立即安装更新，可限制本地用户对敏感虚拟化资源的访问权限，并启用 Credential Guard 和基于虚拟化的安全策略强化作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21340","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21340.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66c0b846661d24b6c0080f2afee2bfee1abc93b1/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21340.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21340.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21340.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21340.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21340.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/fa8022718a8cc564e97d3eb9ab4cc58914ec9a6c/2025/CVE-2025-21340/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2025/CVE-2025-21340.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/fa8022718a8cc564e97d3eb9ab4cc58914ec9a6c/2025/CVE-2025-21340/poc.py","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21340.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0798.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0797","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0797.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21339","title":"Microsoft Windows 电话服务远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows 电话服务（Telephony Service）存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），由于服务在处理特制请求时对输入数据长度校验不严，导致内存损坏。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送恶意构造的请求并诱使其交互（如点击链接或打开恶意文件），在目标系统上以电话服务进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，包括 Windows 10、Windows 11 及 Windows Server 系列，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21339"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:59Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:08Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新。各受影响版本对应的修复版本号：Windows 10 1507 升级至 10.0.10240.20890，Windows 10 1607/Server 2016 升级至 10.0.14393.7699，Windows 10 1809/Server 2019 升级至 10.0.17763.6775，Windows 10 21H2 升级至 10.0.19044.5371，Windows 10 22H2 升级至 10.0.19045.5371，Windows 11 22H2 升级至 10.0.22621.4751，Windows 11 23H2 升级至 10.0.22631.4751，Windows 11 24H2/Server 2025 升级至 10.0.26100.2894，Server 2022 升级至 10.0.20348.3091，Server 2022 23H2 升级至 10.0.25398.1369。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载对应 KB 补丁包。如无法立即打补丁，建议禁用 TAPI 服务（Telephony Service）并在防火墙限制对 RPC 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21339","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21339.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66c0b846661d24b6c0080f2afee2bfee1abc93b1/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21339.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21339.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21339.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/2264199c0bc0c33bf5461ebe5626e7d18358baaf/2025/CVE-2025-21339/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21339.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/2264199c0bc0c33bf5461ebe5626e7d18358baaf/2025/CVE-2025-21339/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21339.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2025/CVE-2025-21339.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21339"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0797.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0796","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0796.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21338","title":"Microsoft Windows GDI+ 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows GDI+ 存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190），由于 GDI+ 组件对整数运算边界处理不当，导致内存破坏。已获得低权限的本地攻击者可通过运行特制的应用程序触发该漏洞，成功利用后可在目标系统上以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Windows 10、Windows 11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5050061）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21338"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:59Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:08Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050061)，通过 Windows Update 自动获取或手动下载安装。受影响 Windows 版本需升级至：Windows 10 22H2 ≥ 10.0.19045.5371、Windows 11 24H2 ≥ 10.0.26100.2894、Windows Server 2016 ≥ 10.0.14393.7699 等对应修复版本。Microsoft Office 用户需升级至：Office for Mac ≥ 16.93.25011212、Office for Android ≥ 16.0.18429.20000、Office for iOS ≥ 2.93.24123014。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制低权限用户登录系统，并禁用 GDI+ 相关组件的网络暴露面作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21338","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21338.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66c0b846661d24b6c0080f2afee2bfee1abc93b1/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21338.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21338.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21338.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/2264199c0bc0c33bf5461ebe5626e7d18358baaf/2025/CVE-2025-21338/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21338.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/2264199c0bc0c33bf5461ebe5626e7d18358baaf/2025/CVE-2025-21338/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21338.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21338","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21338.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0796.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0794","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0794.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21336","title":"Microsoft Windows 加密信息泄露漏洞","description":"Windows 加密信息泄露漏洞（CVE-2025-21336）存在于 Windows 加密服务组件中，属于 CWE-203 可观测差异类漏洞。攻击者可通过本地访问向 Windows 加密子系统发送特制请求，利用加密服务在处理不同输入时产生的可观测行为差异（如响应时间、错误消息或返回值的细微差别），逐步推导出内存中的敏感加密材料（如密钥材料、证书数据或密码哈希）。该漏洞影响范围广泛，涵盖 Windows 10 多个版本（1507/1607/1809/21H2/22H2）、Windows 11 多个版本（22H2/23H2/24H2）以及 Windows Server 2008 至 2025 等多个服务器版本。成功利用该漏洞需要攻击者已在目标系统本地获得低权限访问，且攻击复杂度较高，但由于其影响范围为变更范围且对保密性影响为高，可能导致敏感加密数据泄露，进而被用于进一步横向移动或特权提升。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，受影响用户应安装对应安全更新（如 Windows 10 22H2 需升级至 10.0.19045.5371 及以上版本，Windows 11 23H2 需升级至 10.0.22631.4751 及以上版本）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21336"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:59Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:08Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5050061（Security-only update），该更新适用于 Windows Server 2008 SP2。通过 Microsoft Update Catalog 下载独立安装包，或通过 WSUS 同步推送。安装前须先安装最新的服务栈更新 (SSU) KB5050682。如无法立即打补丁，限制本地用户对加密 API 的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21336","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21336.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21336.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21336.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21336.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/2264199c0bc0c33bf5461ebe5626e7d18358baaf/2025/CVE-2025-21336/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21336.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/2264199c0bc0c33bf5461ebe5626e7d18358baaf/2025/CVE-2025-21336/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21336.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2025/CVE-2025-21336.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21336"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0794.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0800","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0800.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21333","title":"Microsoft Windows Hyper-V NT Kernel Integration VSP 权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows Hyper-V NT Kernel Integration VSP（虚拟化服务提供程序）存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122）。该漏洞源于对 WNF（Windows Notification Facility）状态数据及 I/O 环 IOP_MC_BUFFER_ENTRY 处理不当，导致在 Hyper-V 主机与虚拟机通信的 VSP 组件中发生堆缓冲区溢出。本地攻击者需先获得目标系统低权限账户，通过精心构造的 I/O 环请求触发溢出，从而将权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别，实现完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 Windows Server 2025 Hyper-V 角色，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5050021）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21333"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:58Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:07Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050021)，该更新修复了 Hyper-V NT Kernel Integration VSP 的堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 更新目录网站手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制受影响主机的本地登录权限，仅允许受信任管理员账户登录 Hyper-V 宿主机。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21333","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52436","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-21333-elevated-privilege-exposure-in-windows-hyper-v-by-microsoft-detection-script","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-21333-elevated-privilege-exposure-in-windows-hyper-v-by-microsoft-mitigation-script","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-21333","https://github.com/MrAle98/CVE-2025-21333-POC","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2025/CVE-2025-21333.md","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/ee2cb27a93b5ca2550eb449cdce8936568ca2dd6/wiki/entities/cve-2025-21333.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/be4eb5d180ce03ee7726c0a777ec4071d20eced1/2025/CVE-2025-21333.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ab6f9d01ebd789d88d6c9c80d2c4801a89e1f38f/2025/CVE-2025-21333.json","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/ee2cb27a93b5ca2550eb449cdce8936568ca2dd6/archive/nu1lptr0/CVE-2025-21333.txt","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/ee2cb27a93b5ca2550eb449cdce8936568ca2dd6/archive/gmh5225/CVE-2025-21333-POC.txt","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/ee2cb27a93b5ca2550eb449cdce8936568ca2dd6/description/nu1lptr0/CVE-2025-21333/description_es.txt","